  "verified_semantics": [
    "Actual wide CharNext is expanded as CharNextW and advances one wchar_t unit unconditionally; no surrogate pairing or NUL-sensitive advance is introduced.",
    "Selected const wide StringFindString delegates to wcsstr. Wide SafeStringLen tests a null pointer and otherwise uses wcslen; CSimpleStringT wide StringLength likewise uses NUL-terminated length.",
    "Actual wide ChTraitsBase aliases, CStringT and CSimpleStringT dependent aliases, and StrTraitMFC/StrTraitATL template/base declarations are included in the origin proof.",
    "Active SafeStringLen body expands NULL to zero in these captures. Active and raw body hashes remain distinct; macro-expanded source is authoritative without guessed normalization."
  ],
